+sorot (0.7.1) stable; urgency=medium
+
+  * Fix mirror mode, which raised TypeError on the first paint and never
+    worked in 0.7.0.
+  * Fix a crash at start-up (and in profile import) when a setting held
+    1e999, Infinity or an enormous integer; unusable settings files are now
+    quarantined instead of stopping the application.
+  * Make the start-delay countdown readable, stop the Display page from
+    scrolling sideways at the default window size, and report malformed API
+    URLs and unexpected API responses as ordinary errors.
+  * Fix random segfaults on Wayland (Python GC racing Qt from worker threads;
+    collection now runs only on the main thread) and draw the theme check
+    marks from PNG files so they do not depend on the optional Qt SVG plugin.
+  * Test-suite and CI fixes (X11 and Wayland GUI jobs); document that the
+    .deb needs Debian 13 (it is not installable on Ubuntu 24.04).
+
+ -- Muhammad Andreatama <muhammadandreatama@outlook.com>  Thu, 29 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
+
